ated as 'object gone'. handle_item() then clears the uploaded flag before the re-upload is attempted. If the file is missing or put_object fails, the flag stays cleared even though the bucket object may still exist. Delete-sync is then skipped for that image because on_delete() checks is_uploaded(), and the synced count drops. Clear the flag only after a successful re-upload, or have object_exists() distinguish an absent object (404) from an error.\"}","ttft_ms":5430,"type":"result","duration_ms":10640,"uuid":"36d62d00-ec22-4434-9c06-501b061054e6","ttft_stream_ms":2057,"time_to_request_ms":200,"first_content_frame_ms":2057,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-05T13:04:46.813Z"}
